{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic incidents occurred in the Peace Island area, filled with violence and deaths\uff0c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special police officers will restore peace and joy to the Peace Island area through exploration and combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore Peace Island comprehensively\uff1aStep into areas such as grasslands, mountains, and coasts\uff0cTest the leaping martial arts moves of the special police officers with their gorgeous punches and kicks,Eliminate all kinds of enemies that have lost control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game attack\uff1aYou can attack enemies by punching, jumping and combining punches and kicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Increased health points\uff1aBreaking the box can help you pick up food and replenish your energy\uff0cEliminate the enemies, eat the gold coins, earn high scores. As long as you get a certain number of points, you will be rewarded with 1 health point!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enemy\uff1aThe game requires players to strike enemies with fists and feet. Picking up weapons can strike enemies from a distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game world\uff1aThis is a healthy exercise that tests players' precise and quick key response, allowing them to think while synchronously operating their brain and fingers against numerous enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013660/extras/2338fd6dc8e33e8d120294be876879c5.avif?t=1774107269\" width=1242 height=1844 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4013660?t=1774107269","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013660/c1e33dfa518eec60d0a4cc050a09f9f621cc36fc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774107269","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013660/abd42d